      "text": "Thy hands have made me and fash-ioned me; give me un-der-stand-ing and I will learn__ Thy com--mand---ments. Have mer---cy on me, O Lord.\n\nFor I am be-come like a wine-skin__ in the__ frost; yet Thy stat-utes have I not for--got---ten. Have mer---cy on me, O Lord. \n\nI_ am Thine, save me; for af-ter Thy stat-utes__ have I__ sought. Have mer----cy on me, O Lord.\n\nFrom Thy judg-ments have I__ not de--clined, for Thou hast set a__ law for__ me. Have mer----cy on me, O Lord. \n\nI_ have in-clined___ my heart to per-form Thy stat-utes for ev-er for a__ rec-om--pense. Have mer----cy on me, O Lord.\n\nIt is time for the Lord___ to act; for they have dis--persed Thy__ law. Have mer----cy on me, O Lord. \n\nGlo-ry to the Fa-ther, and to the Son, and to the Ho-ly Spir--it.\n\nBoth now and ev--er, and un-to the ag--es of ag--es. A-men. Have mer-cy on me, O Lord._________"
    }
  }
}